title: Start
---
<<declare $input = false>>
<<declare $awarded = false>>
<<declare $points = 0>>
<<declare $temporary = 0>>
<<checkpoint rules.start>>
<<set $temporary = 1>>
<<set $input = true>>
First points {$points} #line:rules-first
<<if $awarded>>
After rules {$points} #line:rules-after
<<endif>>
===
